{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/challenge
    The challenge of a class: what it is, its marks lit, how many are still to come (never who), and the herald when met.
    Context variables required for this template:
    * heading, text, progresslabel, left - texts
    * marks - one per step (lit)
    * complete - whether it is met
    * herald - what the herald says when it is met (see local_oksigeniaayvurenda/bubble)
    Example context (json):
    {
        "heading": "El reto de tu clase",
        "text": "Libros de 6 rincones distintos, entre todos",
        "marks": [{"lit": true}, {"lit": true}, {"lit": false}],
        "progresslabel": "2 de 3",
        "left": "",
        "complete": false,
        "herald": null
    }
}}
<div class="ayv-challenge{{#complete}} ayv-challenge-done{{/complete}}">
    <span class="ayv-duo-title">{{heading}}</span>
    <span class="ayv-challenge-text">{{text}}{{#listen}} {{> local_oksigeniaayvurenda/listen}}{{/listen}}</span>
    <span class="ayv-challenge-marks" role="img" aria-label="{{progresslabel}}">{{#marks}}<span class="ayv-mark{{#lit}} ayv-mark-lit{{/lit}}"></span>{{/marks}}</span>
    {{#left}}<span class="ayv-field-hint">{{left}}</span>{{/left}}
    {{#herald}}{{> local_oksigeniaayvurenda/bubble}}{{/herald}}
</div>
